# ROM manifest of Makaimura (Japan), the Japanese version of Ghosts'n Goblins (MAME clone
# makaimurg). The layout is gng.manifest's, see there: each chip takes the place of the gngb
# chip at the same MAME region and offset. jotego's mame2mra.toml has no maincpu entry of its
# own for this set, so the program order is gng's. The program is mj03g, mj04g and mj05g, and
# the sprite chips gng13.n4 and gng16.l4 replace gg17 and gg14. The other chips are gng's.

set     makaimurg
title   Makaimura (Japan)
zip     gng.zip
total   360448
board   7
mirror  5760
screen  upright
# the file make_rom.py builds from roms/gng.zip, the candidate for the firmware's digest list
known   3660816e2b431f20364c400336ee23e818f12339aa9ab2a432c1375786175d3f MAME makaimurg
# RetroAchievements game: Ghosts'n Goblins' set, with its switches.
ra      12149
short   Makaimura
dip     L 3
dip     F 3

